    "link": "https://unsplash.com/photos/a-doctor-examining-a-childs-stomach-with-a-stethoscope-kinSYGfBSzc?utm_source=dia_news&utm_medium=referral",
    "alt": "a doctor examining a child's stomach with a stethoscope"
